# Gitignored files a new worktree needs, copied by `wt step copy-ignored`.
# Without these the web app starts in Clerk keyless mode and every signed-in
# request fails a JWKS kid check against a throwaway instance.
#
# Deliberately an allowlist: copying every ignored path also drags in
# build output and caches such as node_modules and infra/terraform/.terraform.
.env
apps/web/.dev.vars
packages/api/.dev.vars
